# oomph top golden frame v2 · 60x16 · machines · selected=local span=24h glyphs=unicode · dialog=pair
--- text
 1 studio ●  2●  3⊘  4▲  5↻  +     3.3G free  Normal  13:27 
─ Pair with studio.local ───────────────────────────────────
                                                            
 First connection to this machine. Sharing must be on       
 there; then ask it for a one-time code:                    
                                                            
   sudo oomph share pair                          ^Y copies 
                                                            
 Code    K7QF  -  2M9X  -  D4                               
                                                            
 Works once, for 10 minutes. The code also proves that      
 nobody sits in between: a wrong machine cannot answer it.  
                                                            
 Key 3288 6121 2BBE 5CC8  same as oomph share status there  
                                                            
 esc back  enter pair  ^Y copy the command                  
